  "body": "Completed in 2022 and further enhanced with thoughtful upgrades, this contemporary four bedroom, three bathroom multi-level home delivers the perfect blend of style, space, and modern beachside living. Every inch has been beautifully refined, creating a home that feels sophisticated, welcoming, and effortlessly in\r\ntune with its coastal surroundings.\r\n\r\nFamilies, professionals, and multi-generational living will all appreciate the clever layout with a double, internal access garage, off street parking, dedicated laundry and two large ensuite bedrooms. \r\n\r\nThe main living level is where the home truly shines. A premium Miele-appointed kitchen anchors the space, complete with thick stone benchtops and sleek cabinetry that will impress even the most discerning buyers. The open-plan living and dining areas flow seamlessly to a sun-drenched deck, creating the ultimate indoor-outdoor zone for entertaining or simply enjoying the coastal breeze.\r\n\r\nOn the top floor, the master suite is a genuine retreat. Elevated views, a generous walk-in wardrobe, underfloor heating in the large ensuite bathroom complete with a bath, and a generous private balcony with sea views come together to offer an indulgent escape at the end of the day-luxury living at its finest.\r\n\r\nBeautiful low-maintenance landscaping, double glazing throughout, and a strong focus on easy-care living make this home as practical as it is stylish. And with zoning for the highly sought-after Macleans College, plus close proximity to Eastern Beach, local cafés, and scenic coastal walks, the lifestyle on offer here is second to none.\r\n\r\nA standout property in a premium location, this is modern coastal living done exceptionally well and offers incredible value. Don't miss your chance to secure it.",
